{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"3a31e2b2c1a5f122","__entryId":"style-material","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-material-scene\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\"><span class=\"style-material-appmark\"></span><b>ROUTE OPS</b><span>配送任务</span><i>⌕</i></div><aside class=\"style-material-rail\"><span class=\"on\">▦</span><span>▱</span><span>◫</span></aside>\n      <div class=\"style-material-scene-body\"><div class=\"style-material-scene-heading\"><b>待执行路线</b><span>8 条</span></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row focus\"><span>08</span><div><b>杭州西</b><small>18 / 22 已签收</small></div><em>16:40</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>12</span><div><b>滨江</b><small>3 / 18 已签收</small></div><em>18:10</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>15</span><div><b>余杭</b><small>等待司机确认</small></div><em>待派发</em></div></div><div class=\"style-material-fab\"><span>＋</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">← 文章<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:15px\">⋮</span></div>\n      <div style=\"height:110px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f51b5,#5c6bc0);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:14px\">\n        <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\">为什么纸会浮起来</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div class=\"style-material-card\" style=\"flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:6px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\">设计周刊 · 6 分钟前</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#424242;line-height:1.7\">Material 用表面层级说明覆盖关系：普通内容留在页面中，临时对话框浮在其上并打断当前任务。</span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:6px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">阅读全文</span>\n            <span style=\