dius:2px;background:#fdd663;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#c58af9;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#78d9ec;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin:2px 14px 12px;background:#323232;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\"><span>已移到「收藏」</span><span style=\"color:#ff80ab;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px\">撤消</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;background:#fff;padding:8px 0 10px\">\n        <span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#3f51b5\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🖼</span>图库</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">📁</span>相册</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">👥</span>共享</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🔍</span>搜索</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"style-material-scene\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\"><span class=\"style-material-appmark\"></span><b>ROUTE OPS</b><span>Distribution task</span><i>⌕</i></div><aside class=\"style-material-rail\"><span class=\"on\">▦</span><span>▱</span><span>◫</span></aside>\n      <div class=\"style-material-scene-body\"><div class=\"style-material-scene-heading\"><b>Routes to be executed</b><span>8 routes</span></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row focus\"><span>08</span><div><b>Hangzhou West</b><small>18 / 22 Signed for</small></div><em>16:40</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>12</span><div><b>Binjiang</b><small>3 / 18 Signed for</small></div><em>18:10</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>15</span><div><b>Yuhang</b><small>Waiting for driver confirmation</small></div><em>To be dispatched</em></div></div><div class=\"style-material-fab\"><span>＋</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">← Article<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:15px\">⋮</span></div>\n      <div style=\"height:110px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f51b5,#5c6bc0);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:14px\">\n        <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\">Why does the paper float</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div class=\"style-material-card\" style=\"flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:6px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\">Design Weekly · 6 minutes ago</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#424242;line-height:1.7\">Material uses a surface level to illustrate the overlay relationship: normal content stays on the page, and temporary dialog boxes float above it and interrupt the current task. </span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:6px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">Read the full text</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">Share</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">Login</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto\">\n        \n        <div style=\"background:#f0f0f0;border-bottom:2px solid #3f51b5;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;padding:6px 10px 4px\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3f51b5\">Email</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#212121\">you@example.com</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#f0f0f0;border-bottom:2px solid #9e9e9e;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;padding:6px 10px 4px\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\">Password</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#212121\">••••••••</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#3f51b5;color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:2px;padding:9px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\">Login</div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">Forgot your password? </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">Photo</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#8ab4f8;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#f28b82;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#81c995;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#fdd663;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#c58af9;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div><div style=\"height:56px;border-radius:2px;background:#78d9ec;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.26)\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin:2px 14px 12px;background:#323232;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\"><span>Moved to \"Favorites\"</span><span style=\"color:#ff80ab;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px\">Undo</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;background:#fff;padding:8px 0 10px\">\n        <span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#3f51b5\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🖼</span>Gallery</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">📁</span>Album</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">👥</span>Share</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🔍</span>Search</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"style-material-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-elev\" data-ap=\"elevation\"><span class=\"e2\">内容层</span><span class=\"e16\">浮层</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-primary-chip\" data-ap=\"primary\">品牌主色示例</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-mini-fab\" data-ap=\"accent\">＋</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-ripple-btn\" data-ap=\"ripple\">按钮<i></i><span class=\"style-material-ripple-ring\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-grid-chip\" data-ap=\"grid\">间距尺度</span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"style-material-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-elev\" data-ap=\"elevation\"><span class=\"e2\">Content layer</span><span class=\"e16\">Floating layer</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-primary-chip\" data-ap=\"primary\">Brand primary color example</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-mini-fab\" data-ap=\"accent\">＋</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-ripple-btn\" data-ap=\"ripple\">Button<i></i><span class=\"style-material-ripple-ring\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-material-grid-chip\" data-ap=\"grid\">Spacing scale</span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"elevation","cn":"内容层级","en":"Elevation","desc":"用容器、位置和适度阴影说明谁覆盖谁；强度按组件关系调整","desc_en":"Use container, position, and moderate shading to illustrate who covers whom; intensity adjusts by component relationship"},{"key":"primary","cn":"语义颜色","en":"Color Roles","desc":"为品牌、状态和主要操作分配稳定的颜色职责，并在不同背景上测试可读性","desc_en":"Assign stable color responsibilities to branding, status, and key actions and test readability on different backgrounds"},{"key":"accent","cn":"主要操作","en":"Primary Action","desc":"悬浮按钮可用于高频发起动作；不是每个页面都必须出现","desc_en":"Floating buttons can be used to initiate actions frequently; they do not have to appear on every page"},{"key":"ripple","cn":"墨水涟漪","en":"Ink Ripple","desc":"点按反馈可从触点向外扩散，用于提示操作已被接收","desc_en":"Click feedback can spread outward from the touch point to indicate that the operation has been received"},{"key":"grid","cn":"间距规则","en":"Spacing","desc":"建立可复用的间距与尺寸关系，并允许内容、语言和无障碍需求带来例外","desc_en":"Establish reusable spacing and sizing relationships and allow exceptions for content, language, and accessibility needs"}]},"use":[{"t":"Android 和跨端应用，需要成熟的组件体系","m":"style-material-android"},{"t":"表单较多的产品，需要一致的字段和状态规范","m":"style-material-form"},{"t":"卡片信息流，用表面层级组织内容","m":"style-material-list"},{"t":"需要动态主题时，参考 Material You 的颜色体系","m":"style-material-theming"}],"dont":[{"t":"同时使用过多阴影层级，界面显得复杂","m":"style-material-shadows-bad","bad":true},{"t":"强调色覆盖所有元素，失去真正重点","m":"style-material-accent-bad","bad":true},{"t":"一屏出现多个同等重要的悬浮主按钮","m":"style-material-fabs-bad","bad":true},{"t":"只复制颜色和涟漪效果，不理解组件体系","m":"style-material-copy-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"用表面层级和阴影说明元素的前后关系","m":"style-material-elevation"},{"t":"点击反馈要及时，让用户知道操作已经发生","m":"style-material-ripple"},{"t":"每个区域只突出真正重要的主要动作","m":"style-material-fab-one"},{"t":"为主色、强调色和状态色分配清楚职责","m":"style-material-color"},{"t":"动效用于解释元素从哪里来、将到哪里去","m":"style-material-motion"}],"history":[{"year":"2014.06","title":"Google I/O 发布","desc":"Google 发布 Material Design，以纸面隐喻、动效和组件规则为 Android 及其产品提供了统一的设计系统参考。","title_en":"Material Design launches at Google I/O","desc_en":"Paper-like layers, ripple feedback, and the floating action button gave Android a shared system-wide design language."},{"year":"2015—2017","title":"Google 产品陆续采用","desc":"Gmail、日历、地图等产品陆续更新，Material 的组件与实现资源也逐步完善，并被用于多种平台。","title_en":"Material spreads across Google's products","desc_en":"Gmail, Calendar, Maps, and other services adopted the system as the component ecosystem matured across platforms."},{"year":"2018","title":"Material Theming","desc":"开放品牌定制：形状、色板、字体都能换，回应「所有 App 长得一样」的批评。","title_en":"Material Theming opens brand customization","desc_en":"Shape, color, and type became easier to customize in response to criticism that every Material app looked the same."},{"year":"2021","title":"Material You","desc":"Android 12 引入动态取色，可基于壁纸生成系统配色。","title_en":"Material You adds dynamic color","desc_en":"Android 12 introduced themes derived from a user's wallpaper, making the system more personal while keeping shared structure."}],"prompt":"做一个配送调度应用，用户能查看路线状态、处理待派发任务并新建派单。使用一致的组件、清楚的状态反馈和有意义的层级；颜色、阴影和悬浮操作按任务需要选择，不要套旧版固定样式。只接入项目现有的路线、任务和状态字段，缺少数据时显示明确空状态。","prompt_en":"Material Design interface, indigo primary color with a restrained pink accent, consistent component tokens, elevation that explains layers, floating action button where appropriate, ripple feedback and clear states","references":[{"title":"Material Design 3","source":"Material Design","url":"https://m3.material.io/","title_en":"Material Design"}],"scenes":["Material 物流调度","Material 文章卡片页","Material 登录表单","Material 底部导航与 Snackbar"],"en":{"prompt":"Material Design interface, indigo primary color with a restrained pink accent, consistent component tokens, elevation that explains layers, floating action button where appropriate, ripple feedback and clear states","use":[{"t":"Android and cross-platform product","m":"style-material-android"},{"t":"Large interface needing a mature component system","m":"style-material-form"},{"t":"Team that benefits from documented patterns","m":"style-material-list"},{"t":"Rapid product work with accessibility requirements","m":"style-material-theming"}],"dont":[{"t":"Copy default components without matching the product's content","m":"style-material-shadows-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Use elevation as decoration","m":"style-material-accent-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Mix several design systems in one flow","m":"style-material-fabs-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Customize each component independently until the system disappears","m":"style-material-copy-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Build from reusable components and tokens","m":"style-material-elevation"},{"t":"Use elevation only to explain layer relationships","m":"style-material-ripple"},{"t":"Give every interactive state visible feedback","m":"style-material-fab-one"},{"t":"Let motion connect cause and result","m":"style-material-color"},{"t":"Adapt the system to the brand without breaking consistency","m":"style-material-motion"}],"scenes":["Mobile app","Web dashboard","Component library","Cross-platform product"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-material-scene\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\"><span class=\"style-material-appmark\"></span><b>ROUTE OPS</b><span>Distribution task</span><i>⌕</i></div><aside class=\"style-material-rail\"><span class=\"on\">▦</span><span>▱</span><span>◫</span></aside>\n      <div class=\"style-material-scene-body\"><div class=\"style-material-scene-heading\"><b>Routes to be executed</b><span>8 routes</span></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row focus\"><span>08</span><div><b>Hangzhou West</b><small>18 / 22 Signed for</small></div><em>16:40</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>12</span><div><b>Binjiang</b><small>3 / 18 Signed for</small></div><em>18:10</em></div><div class=\"style-material-scene-row\"><span>15</span><div><b>Yuhang</b><small>Waiting for driver confirmation</small></div><em>To be dispatched</em></div></div><div class=\"style-material-fab\"><span>＋</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">← Article<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:15px\">⋮</span></div>\n      <div style=\"height:110px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f51b5,#5c6bc0);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:14px\">\n        <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\">Why does the paper float</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div class=\"style-material-card\" style=\"flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:6px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\">Design Weekly · 6 minutes ago</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#424242;line-height:1.7\">Material uses a surface level to illustrate the overlay relationship: normal content stays on the page, and temporary dialog boxes float above it and interrupt the current task. </span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:6px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">Read the full text</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3f51b5;letter-spacing:1px\">Share</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fafafa;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\">\n      <div class=\"style-material-appbar\">Login</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto\">\n  