-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.3)\"><span>Moved to \"Favorites\"</span><span style=\"color:#ff80ab;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px\">Undo</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;background:#fff;padding:8px 0 10px\">\n        <span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#3f51b5\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🖼</span>Gallery</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">📁</span>Album</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">👥</span>Share</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:12px;color:#9e9e9e\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">🔍</span>Search</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"history":[{"title":"Material Design launches at Google I/O","desc":"Paper-like layers, ripple feedback, and the floating action button gave Android a shared system-wide design language."},{"title":"Material spreads across Google's products","desc":"Gmail, Calendar, Maps, and other services adopted the system as the component ecosystem matured across platforms."},{"title":"Material Theming opens brand customization","desc":"Shape, color, and type became easier to customize in response to criticism that every Material app looked the same."},{"title":"Material You adds dynamic color","desc":"Android 12 introduced themes derived from a user's wallpaper, making the system more personal while keeping shared structure."}]},"usageMocks":{"style-material-android":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-phone\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:130px\">可参考 Android 平台的组件与交互规范</span></div>","style-material-form":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;border-bottom:2px solid #3f51b5;background:#f0f0f0;padding:3px 8px;font-size:12px;text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#3f51b5;font-size:12px\">邮箱</span><br><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">you@example.com</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">浮动标签可明确字段名称与输入状态</span></div>","style-material-list":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-material-ava\" style=\"background:#e91e63;width:24px;height:24px\">A</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-material-ava\" style=\"background:#3f51b5;width:24px;height:24px\">B</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i></div></div>","style-material-theming":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:40px;height:30px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8ab4f8,#f28b82)\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"style-material-ava\" style=\"background:#8ab4f8;width:22px;height:22px\"></span><span class=\"style-material-ava\" style=\"background:#f28b82;width:22px;height:22px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Material You 可基于壁纸生成配色</span>","style-material-shadows-bad":"<span class=\"style-material-elev\"><span class=\"e2\"></span><span class=\"e8\"></span><span class=\"e16\"></span><span class=\"e16\"></span><span class=\"e16\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">过多阴影层级会干扰界面关系</span>","style-material-accent-bad":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-material-mini-fab\">＋</span><span class=\"style-material-mini-fab\">✎</span><span class=\"style-flat-mini-btn\" style=\"background:#ff4081;border-radius:2px\">按钮</span><span class=\"style-flat-mini-btn\" style=\"background:#ff4081;border-radius:2px\">链接</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">强调色过多会削弱主操作与状态的区分</span>","style-material-fabs-bad":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-material-mini-fab\">＋</span><span class=\"style-material-mini-fab\">✎</span><span class=\"style-material-mini-fab\">★</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">多个悬浮主操作会使优先级不清楚</span>","style-material-copy-bad":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-material-ripple-btn\" style=\"background:#9c27b0\">紫色按钮</span><span class=\"style-material-ripple-btn\" style=\"background:#e91e63\">玫红按钮</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">只采用配色而未建立组件与状态规则</span>"}}}